# Server upload zip

When you create a zip to upload to pranavps.com, update `SERVER_UPLOAD.md` and put that same file inside the zip.

The note says how far the work goes in this upload:

- Features included, and the site or API files that carry them
- What is still not on the server after this upload (for example the phone app binary, or a feature that exists only in the repo)

Replace the previous note. Do not leave a description of an older zip.

```markdown
# Server upload

Built: 2026-10-12

## Included
- Blog posts can be published from the API and opened on the site.

## Not in this upload
- The Flutter app binary. Install that on the phone separately.
```

Do not put secrets in the zip or the note: `php-api/config.php`, `.env`, `.env.local`, or files already stored under `php-api/uploads/`.
